Package: tizenos-installer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, parted, cryptsetup, dosfstools, e2fsprogs
Description: OS Installation Wizard for TizenOS
 GTK4 based 7-step installer wizard for TizenOS (Debian based).
 Supports full disk erase, LUKS encryption, ESP, and ext4 rootfs.
